<title>USA: FGIC qualifies Clark Cty SD, Nev., for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies Clark Cty SD, Nev., for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. said it has qualified for bond insurance Clark County SD, Nev., $300 million general obligation bonds, scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
